              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="scroll-step finale" data-scroll-step>
              <h3>Then the payoff lands.</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="notes">
            Slide kind: SCROLL-DRIVEN NARRATIVE. A long downward-scrolling section
